# MCP layer + protocol docs
/mcp/                       @FutureAI-global/maintainers
/docs/                      @FutureAI-global/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @FutureAI-global/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                @FutureAI-global/maintainers

# Per-OEM bridges — additional reviewers as bridges land. The Ford-FDRS
# reference is org-maintained; new OEM bridges land with their author
# auto-added here.
/bridges/ford-fdrs/         @FutureAI-global/maintainers

# Template scaffold — affects every future bridge author
/bridges/_template/         @FutureAI-global/maintainers
